<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Gesture Handler State Machine — gesture-coordination</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; background: #fff; color: #222; padding: 24px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.1em; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #2c3e50; }
  .caption { font-size: 0.83em; color: #666; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .sm-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  svg text { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; }
  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.82em; }
  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .legend-dot { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .findings-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .finding-card { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; background: #fafafa; }
  .finding-card h3 { font-size: 0.88em; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .finding-card p { font-size: 0.82em; color: #444; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.75em; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 10px; margin-right: 4px; font-weight: 600; }
  .tag-fix { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
  .tag-new { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }
  .two-block { background: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffc107; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.85em; }
  .one-block { background: #d4edda; border: 1px solid #28a745; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.85em; }
  .arrow-label { font-size: 11px; fill: #555; }
  .state-idle { fill: #4a90d9; }
  .state-down { fill: #5ba85b; }
  .state-pending { fill: #e67e22; }
  .state-dragging { fill: #8e44ad; }
  .state-lp { fill: #c0392b; }
  .state-resolved { fill: #2c3e50; }
  .state-text { fill: white; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; }
  .edge { stroke: #666; stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; marker-end: url(#arrowhead); }
  .edge-c1 { stroke: #4a90d9; stroke-width: 2; }
  .edge-c2 { stroke: #e67e22; stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 3; }
  .edge-c3 { stroke: #c0392b; stroke-width: 2; }
  .edge-normal { stroke: #666; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h2>Coordinated Gesture Handler — State Machine</h2>
<p class="caption">
  The merged single <code>pointerInput(Unit)</code> block replaces the two uncoordinated sibling blocks.
  Findings addressed by each transition are colour-coded.
</p>

<div class="two-block">
  <strong>Before (broken):</strong> Two independent sibling <code>pointerInput</code> blocks, each consuming events
  from the same stream. Double-tap fires <code>onClick</code> <em>twice</em> from the loop, then
  <code>onDoubleClick</code> once from <code>detectTapGestures</code> — no coordination. <span class="tag tag-fix">C1 broken</span>
</div>
<div class="one-block">
  <strong>After (fixed):</strong> Single <code>awaitEachGesture { detectTapGestures(...) + hand-rolled drag/longpress }</code>.
  <code>detectTapGestures</code> owns disambiguation; drag and long-press integrate via <code>onPress</code>.
  <span class="tag tag-fix">C1 C2 C3 F4 fixed</span>
</div>

<div class="sm-wrap">
<svg viewBox="0 0 860 540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;max-width:860px;min-width:600px;">
  <defs>
    <marker id="arrowhead" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto">
      <polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#666"/>
    </marker>
    <marker id="arrowhead-c1" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto">
      <polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#4a90d9"/>
    </marker>
    <marker id="arrowhead-c3" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto">
      <polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#c0392b"/>
    </marker>
    <marker id="arrowhead-c2" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto">
      <polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#e67e22"/>
    </marker>
  </defs>

  <!-- ── STATES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <!-- IDLE -->
  <ellipse cx="100" cy="80" rx="72" ry="28" class="state-idle"/>
  <text x="100" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">IDLE</text>

  <!-- DOWN (press received) -->
  <ellipse cx="100" cy="200" rx="72" ry="28" class="state-down"/>
  <text x="100" y="205" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">DOWN</text>

  <!-- TAP-PENDING (first release, within double-tap window) -->
  <ellipse cx="330" cy="200" rx="88" ry="28" class="state-pending"/>
  <text x="330" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">TAP-PENDING</text>
  <text x="330" y="214" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:white;font-size:10px;">(~300ms window)</text>

  <!-- DRAGGING -->
  <ellipse cx="100" cy="340" rx="72" ry="28" class="state-dragging"/>
  <text x="100" y="345" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">DRAGGING</text>

  <!-- LONG-PRESS-FIRED -->
  <ellipse cx="330" cy="340" rx="88" ry="28" class="state-lp"/>
  <text x="330" y="340" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">LONG-PRESS</text>
  <text x="330" y="354" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:white;font-size:10px;">longPressFired=true</text>

  <!-- RESOLVED: onClick -->
  <ellipse cx="570" cy="130" rx="80" ry="28" class="state-resolved"/>
  <text x="570" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">→ onClick</text>
  <text x="570" y="143" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#aed6f1;font-size:10px;">instant (no onDoubleClick)</text>

  <!-- RESOLVED: onClick (delayed) -->
  <ellipse cx="570" cy="210" rx="80" ry="28" class="state-resolved"/>
  <text x="570" y="208" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">→ onClick</text>
  <text x="570" y="223" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#aed6f1;font-size:10px;">after window expires</text>

  <!-- RESOLVED: onDoubleClick -->
  <ellipse cx="760" cy="200" rx="86" ry="28" class="state-resolved"/>
  <text x="760" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">→ onDoubleClick</text>
  <text x="760" y="213" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#aed6f1;font-size:10px;">zero onClick (C1 fix)</text>

  <!-- RESOLVED: onDragEnd -->
  <ellipse cx="100" cy="460" rx="80" ry="28" class="state-resolved"/>
  <text x="100" y="458" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">→ onDragEnd</text>
  <text x="100" y="472" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#aed6f1;font-size:10px;">C2: consume only if acting</text>

  <!-- RESOLVED: onLongClick -->
  <ellipse cx="330" cy="460" rx="80" ry="28" class="state-resolved"/>
  <text x="330" y="458" text-anchor="middle" class="state-text">→ onLongClick</text>
  <text x="330" y="472" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:#aed6f1;font-size:10px;">C3: draggedNode=null guard</text>

  <!-- ── EDGES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <!-- IDLE → DOWN -->
  <line x1="100" y1="108" x2="100" y2="172" class="edge edge-normal" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
  <text x="108" y="144" class="arrow-label">Press</text>
  <text x="108" y="156" class="arrow-label">dragStartPos=pos</text>

  <!-- DOWN → TAP-PENDING (first release — not drag, no double tap yet) -->
  <line x1="172" y1="200" x2="242" y2="200" class="edge edge-c1" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c1)" stroke="#4a90d9" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="196" y="193" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#4a90d9">Release</text>
  <text x="196" y="205" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#4a90d9">(has onDblClick)</text>

  <!-- DOWN → DRAGGING (move > threshold) -->
  <line x1="100" y1="228" x2="100" y2="312" class="edge edge-c2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c2)" stroke="#e67e22" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="8" y="270" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#e67e22">Move &gt;</text>
  <text x="8" y="282" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#e67e22">threshold</text>

  <!-- DOWN → LONG-PRESS-FIRED -->
  <path d="M 172 200 Q 250 260 242 340" class="edge edge-c3" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c3)"/>
  <text x="226" y="264" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#c0392b">delay(longPressMs)</text>

  <!-- TAP-PENDING → onClick (window expires, no second tap) -->
  <line x1="418" y1="192" x2="490" y2="152" class="edge edge-c1" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c1)" stroke="#4a90d9" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="432" y="168" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#4a90d9">window expires</text>
  <text x="432" y="180" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#4a90d9">no 2nd tap</text>

  <!-- TAP-PENDING → onDoubleClick (2nd tap arrives) -->
  <line x1="418" y1="208" x2="674" y2="208" class="edge edge-c1" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c1)" stroke="#4a90d9" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="490" y="202" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#4a90d9">2nd tap arrives</text>
  <text x="490" y="214" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#1a6ba0;font-weight:700">→ zero onClick</text>

  <!-- DOWN → onClick instant (no onDoubleClick registered) -->
  <path d="M 172 188 Q 330 120 490 130" class="edge edge-c1" stroke="#4a90d9" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c1)"/>
  <text x="280" y="132" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#4a90d9">Release (onClick only)</text>
  <text x="280" y="144" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#1a6ba0;font-weight:700">instant fire</text>

  <!-- DRAGGING → onDragEnd (C2 consumption gated) -->
  <line x1="100" y1="368" x2="100" y2="432" class="edge edge-c2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c2)" stroke="#e67e22" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="8" y="406" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#e67e22">Release</text>

  <!-- LONG-PRESS-FIRED → onLongClick (C3: draggedNode not assigned) -->
  <line x1="330" y1="368" x2="330" y2="432" class="edge edge-c3" marker-end="url(#arrowhead-c3)" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="338" y="406" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#c0392b">Release / timeout</text>

  <!-- All resolved states → IDLE (reset) -->
  <path d="M 490 130 Q 50 480 28 80" class="edge edge-normal" stroke="#999" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
  <text x="12" y="140" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#999">reset →</text>
  <text x="12" y="152" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#999">IDLE</text>

  <!-- ── C3 annotation ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <rect x="490" y="310" width="220" height="54" rx="4" fill="#fdecea" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="500" y="327" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#c0392b;font-weight:700">C3 guard (new):</text>
  <text x="500" y="341" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#555">draggedNode = if (longPressFired)</text>
  <text x="500" y="355" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#555">  null else resolveDraggedNode(…)</text>

  <!-- ── C2 annotation ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <rect x="140" y="310" width="165" height="54" rx="4" fill="#fff3cd" stroke="#e67e22" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="150" y="327" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#c97a00;font-weight:700">C2 guard (new):</text>
  <text x="150" y="341" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#555">consume only when:</text>
  <text x="150" y="355" class="arrow-label" style="fill:#555">handler || camera || node</text>
</svg>
</div>

<div class="legend">
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#4a90d9"></div> <span><strong>C1</strong> tap/double-tap disambiguation (blue edges)</span></div>
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#e67e22"></div> <span><strong>C2</strong> consumption gating (orange dashed edges)</span></div>
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#c0392b"></div> <span><strong>C3</strong> state reset / long-press guard (red edges)</span></div>
  <div class="legend-item"><div class="legend-dot" style="background:#555"></div> <span>Normal transitions (grey)</span></div>
</div>

<div class="findings-grid" style="margin-top:24px;">
  <div class="finding-card">
    <h3><span class="tag tag-fix">C1</span> Double-tap disambiguation</h3>
    <p>Two sibling blocks → one merged block. <code>detectTapGestures(onTap, onDoubleTap)</code>
    waits out ~300ms before firing <code>onTap</code> when both are registered. For onClick-only
    nodes, <code>onTap</code> fires instantly (no <code>onDoubleTap</code> registered).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="finding-card">
    <h3><span class="tag tag-fix">C2</span> Consumption gating</h3>
    <p>Events consumed ONLY when a handler, drag state, or camera is active.
    Inert scenes (no callbacks, no camera) propagate all events to parent composables
    (e.g., a LazyColumn embedding the scene).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="finding-card">
    <h3><span class="tag tag-fix">C3</span> State reset</h3>
    <p>Long-press → drag → release resets all state cleanly. The
    <code>draggedNode</code> assignment now checks <code>!longPressFired</code>, so
    long-press cannot silently activate the node-drag affordance.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="finding-card">
    <h3><span class="tag tag-new">F4</span> Autopan-suppression test</h3>
    <p>New test in <code>DragANodeTest</code> pins that selecting a node suppresses
    camera autopan during drag. The branch condition (node-drag path vs. camera.pan path)
    is now explicitly covered.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div style="margin-top:20px;padding:12px 16px;background:#f5f7ff;border:1px solid #5c6bc0;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.83em;">
  <strong>Constructive-proof rule:</strong> <code>DoubleTapDisambiguationTest</code> tests must
  demonstrably <span style="color:#cc0000;font-weight:700">FAIL</span> against the pre-fix two-block
  implementation. Write them <em>first</em> (Step 1), confirm RED on current code, then apply the
  merge (Step 6) and confirm GREEN. This is the evidence that the tests observe the defect.
</div>

</body>
</html>
